        "procedure": "In a separate experiment identical to the preparation of 1 (diphenyldipyrrolylmethane 1.0 g, 3.4 mmol; KH 0.25 g, 6.7 mmol; YbI2(THF)2 1.92 g, 3.36 mmol in THF 100 mL), stirring was continued for 7 days. The solution was centrifuged, concentrated (40 mL), and layered with hexanes (30 mL). After a few days colorless and green crystals grew over a red powder. After several THF extractions to solubilize the red powder, the red extracts were concentrated to 20 mL and layered with hexane (20 mL) to give 1. Pure emerald-green crystals of 2 remained as an insoluble residue (0.1 g, 0.039 mmol, 5%).",
